{"4872320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cardfight: Conspiracy", "steam_appid": 4872320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I'M HERE TO SLING CARDS AND WHOOP BUTT... AND I'M ALL OUTTA CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A TURN-BASED CARD BATTLER WITH REAL-TIME DEFENSE</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your classmates to learn new cards and hone your battle deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the perfect party of three, each with their own weapons, armor, and character-specific deck to draw from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful card combos with your party in classic JRPG fashion...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>And then DODGE, DUCK, and JUMP your way through the enemy's attacks to land a powerful COUNTER!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A STORY-RICH RPG TOLD FROM MULTIPLE PERSPECTIVES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A martial arts school club kills in secret to protect a deadly weapon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious cult across the street trains for an apocalyptic war...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you - you call yourself Spartan Jack - are caught in the middle of it all when you move to a remote mountain town, where your new friends are part of a deadly secret society that might stab you in the back, and your heirloom family sword begins to show signs of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your friends might be powerful, but you can't count on them... When allegiances shift, prepare for WAR!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I'M HERE TO SLING CARDS AND WHOOP BUTT... AND I'M ALL OUTTA CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A TURN-BASED CARD BATTLER WITH REAL-TIME DEFENSE</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your classmates to learn new cards and hone your battle deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the perfect party of three, each with their own weapons, armor, and character-specific deck to draw from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful card combos with your party in classic JRPG fashion...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>And then DODGE, DUCK, and JUMP your way through the enemy's attacks to land a powerful COUNTER!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A STORY-RICH RPG TOLD FROM MULTIPLE PERSPECTIVES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A martial arts school club kills in secret to protect a deadly weapon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious cult across the street trains for an apocalyptic war...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you - you call yourself Spartan Jack - are caught in the middle of it all when you move to a remote mountain town, where your new friends are part of a deadly secret society that might stab you in the back, and your heirloom family sword begins to show signs of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your friends might be powerful, but you can't count on them... When allegiances shift, prepare for WAR!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "A story-rich RPG told from multiple perspectives. A fusion of turn-based card battling and quick-time defense. Six classmates, each with their own decks - and their own secrets. Your name is SPARTAN JACK, your new friends are part of a deadly secret society, and you have a conspiracy to uncover.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4872320/2b84134b277c4271402318f958d89cb4285317fd/header.jpg?t=1783620315", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea